{
  "$comment": "WCAG contrast pairings for Nightwire (FR-014, SC-005). Checked by `npm run design:contrast` and tests/contrast.test.mjs. fg and bg entries are custom-property names or literal colours; bg is the surface stack, bottom first; kind is text (4.5:1), large-text (3:1) or ui (3:1); levels (default [operator]) lists the intensities to evaluate; opacity multiplies the foreground alpha. exempt entries are not checked; an entry may list `tokens` it covers, which satisfies the drift guard in tests/contrast.test.mjs (every token a src/components rule sets as `color:` must be an fg here or in an exempt entry tokens). No component sits on --nw-surface-4 yet, so it is checked only for body text, muted labels and control boundaries.",
