    {"id":"btn-ai-hover-border-on-raised","where":".btn-ai:hover border, --nw-ai-mute (#8844bb) on --void-raised; measures 2.97:1","reason":"Hover is not a state the control needs to be identified by: the resting boundary (--nw-line-strong) already meets 3:1 and the label carries identification, so the hover border is a lift, not a boundary. Same treatment as .btn-ghost:hover. The border passes 3:1 on the other three surfaces and is checked there."},
